#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/compare-comsol-discharge-curve.ipynb:9
msgid "Comparison of PyBaMM and COMSOL Discharge Curves"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/compare-comsol-discharge-curve.ipynb:20
msgid ""
"In this notebook we compare the discharge curves obtained by solving the DFN "
"model both in PyBaMM and COMSOL. Results are presented for a range of C-"
"rates, and we see an excellent agreement between the two implementations. If "
"you would like to compare internal variables please see the script "
"`compare_comsol_DFN <https://github.com/pybamm-team/PyBaMM/blob/main/"
"examples/scripts/compare_comsol/compare_comsol_DFN.py>`__ which creates a "
"slider plot comparing potentials and concentrations as functions of time and "
"space for a given C-rate. For more information on the DFN model, see the "
"`DFN notebook <https://github.com/pybamm-team/PyBaMM/blob/main/docs/source/"
"examples/notebooks/models/DFN.ipynb>`__."
msgstr ""

